  "description": "FOGGUG crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C208 H264 N16 O64 Yb4 Zn8 4+,4(H1 O1 1-),x(C4 H10 O1),y(C2 H6 O1),z(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 10 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 10 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 9 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 10 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn3 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn4 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn5 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn6 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn7 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors; Zn8 (Zn) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 4 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.518-3.576 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.53-107.18°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Zn8Yb4(L2)8(OAc)8](OH)4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
